  "description": "The Fargo 32 steel frameset expands on Fargo’s already legendary capability. It all starts with our triple-butted steel tubing and a carbon fiber fork for a supportive, comfortable, and durable ride. 32\" wheels add exceptional stability while carrying more momentum and putting down more traction — which means more mixed-surface freedom. Cargo mounts galore give you flexibility to load up for a day or a month of Adventure by Bike. Our Alternator dropouts are UDH-ready out of the box and give you a world of hub and drivetrain options with our selection of Alternator plates (sold separately). The Fargo 32 steel frameset is the perfect platform to build a 32-inch bike that will take you as far and wide as your imagination can muster.",
